BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Introduction to Buddhism & Meditation Course
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/London:20260629T191500
DTEND;TZID=Europe/London:20260629T214500
UID:43142dec1b4d5032fd4946fb@lbc-ics
DESCRIPTION:This six-week course on Monday evenings will introduce you to 
 key Buddhist principles and two meditation practices that cultivate self-a
 wareness\, open-heartedness\, and insight.
URL:https://www.londonbuddhistcentre.com/whats-on/introduction-to-buddhism
 -meditation-course-jun-26
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Mindfulness for Stress (Online)
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/London:20260702T190000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/London:20260702T210000
UID:214dac45f4e3e4b5c71bf793@lbc-ics
DESCRIPTION:This eight-week evidence-based course is designed to help you 
 manage stress and overwhelm in your life. This course teaches practical mi
 ndfulness tools to reduce stress\, calm anxiety\, and bring balance to dai
 ly life.
URL:https://www.londonbuddhistcentre.com/whats-on/mindfulness-for-stress-o
 nline-jul-26
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Digital Dharma Course
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/London:20260728T191500
DTEND;TZID=Europe/London:20260728T213000
UID:eb7da67d2e28d701ac83a5b5@lbc-ics
DESCRIPTION:The Buddha taught that the root cause of our suffering is crav
 ing. Nowadays one of the most striking ways to see this truth is paying at
 tention to our relationship to our phones. In this six-week course\, disco
 ver ancient practices and modern tools that help us to use technology more
  wisely and clear the way for a more meaningful life.
URL:https://www.londonbuddhistcentre.com/whats-on/digital-dharma
END:VEVENT
